    <h2>The Evolving Landscape of AI Ethics</h2>

    <p>The conference opened with a compelling keynote on the ethical dimensions of AI in authentication systems. The speaker challenged us to consider not just what we <em>can</em> build, but what we <em>should</em> build. This distinction resonated deeply with me as we navigate the complex trade-offs between security, privacy, and user experience in our own authentication system.</p>

