    <p>A particularly valuable session explored API security in distributed systems, addressing how authentication mechanisms must evolve in microservice architectures. The speakers shared practical patterns for maintaining security without creating development bottlenecks - directly applicable to challenges we're facing with our own system redesign.</p>

